SAMPLE LOG  —  trading_bot/logs/trading.log
This file illustrates what the rotating log looks like after running the bot.
Four scenarios are shown: MARKET BUY, LIMIT SELL, STOP-LIMIT BUY, and a
validation failure (missing --price on a LIMIT order).
